     "value": "After removing the voxels below the cerebellum with MRIcro, MRI scans were analyzed with SPM99 running under Matlab 6.0. The preprocessing included creation of a gray matter template, normalization of the gray matter to the template, segmentation, smoothing, and visual inspection for gross segmentation errors.",
